      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On Open Beta (1486) I was having frequent issues with constraints entirely breaking. Most obvious as I was using a digi avatar using the constraint method, but also visible in other avatars. Anything that relied on constraints - at least my constraints (didn't check if it impacted others) would stop working. Only fix I found was to restart. World change, avatar change didn't fix it.\n\nedit: I had to restart multiple times during a couple hour period. I ended up switching back to live and no issues since then.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
