      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}I I am unable to provide any specific avatar IDs that definitively cause it. I don't know if a single avatar is triggering it - I always notice it on avtr_de31320d-052f-4f45-855a-8783924d9154 first and it may be something with that avatar triggering it - but when it happens it impacts EVERY avatar. Changing avatars or worlds does NOT resolve it. (I have tested both changing worlds and switching between multiple avatars using constraints)\n\nI say I notice it on that avatar first because that avatar uses a digi system so the whole lower half freezes up when they break making it very obvious, and I've been using that avatar the most. But once I notice it, I can switch to any avatar that uses constraints and have been able to verify they don't work on that avatar, either.\n\nThere is a possibility it's not even my avatar triggering it - the whole system appears to break, so it could even be constraints on another avatar or a bug in the constraint system in general.\n\nedit: between this and gestures not registering correctly anymore I switched back to live, but if you need anything specific/I can try to narrow it down I can go back to the beta, but these issues I've filed are REALLY annoying and both cleared up as soon as I switched back to live.\n\nedit 2: Happens when on Q2 via Virtual Desktop w/out FBT and using Pimax w/ FBT. RTX 3090 + AMD 5900x",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
