      "value": "More info:\n\nChecking my log, I see an exception related to constraints. A lot of them.\n\nThis is first reported at 01:41:39 on an avatar change. I noticed it at 01:45.\n\nAvatar I was switching into was avtr_c84704f3-780c-44fa-8af7-cd5523818251 - this is an old avatar and I believe it has a constraint to enable visible in first person.\n\nI was in world wrld_406f2958-2588-460b-a9d9-5bfcf35bab5f when this happened.\n\n```\n\n2024.08.10 01:41:39 Exception  -  Index was out of range. Must be non-negative and less than the size of the collection.\n\nParameter name: index\n\n  at System.Collections.Generic.List`1[T].get_Item (System.Int32 index) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.VRCConstraintGrouper.PrepareGroupsForReorganize (System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList`1[VRC.Dynamics.VRCConstraintBase]& constraintsManaged) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.VRCConstraintGrouper.RefreshGroups (System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList`1[VRC.Dynamics.VRCConstraintBase]& constraintsManaged) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.VRCConstraintManager.UpdateConstraints (System.Boolean finalizeImmediately) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n```\n\nThese occur continuously until 02:12:21 when it changes the exception. This new exception persists until I exit:\n\n```\n\n2024.08.10 02:12:21 Exception  -  Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.AimVRCConstraintBinding.ToVrcWorldUpType (UnityEngine.Animations.AimConstraint+WorldUpType unityUpType) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.AimVRCConstraintBinding.ToVrcWorldUpType (UnityEngine.Animations.AimConstraint+WorldUpType unityUpType) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.VRCConstraintBase.ReorganizeGroupsFastForRoot (System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList`1[T] unprocessedConstraints, System.Collections.Generic.IDictionary`2[TKey,TValue] executionGroups) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.VRCConstraintGrouper.RefreshGroups (System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList`1[VRC.Dynamics.VRCConstraintBase]& constraintsManaged) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.VRCConstraintManager.UpdateConstraints (System.Boolean finalizeImmediately) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n```\n\nI've saved the full log. Compressed it's 7M.",
